# ==============================================================================
# Build & Output Directories
# ==============================================================================
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]in/
[Oo]utput/
[Oo]utput[Ff]ile*/
out/
generated/
*.pack
!Content/**/shaders/bin/
!Content/**/shaders/bin/**

# ==============================================================================
# IDE & Tooling
# ==============================================================================
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/keybindings.json
launch.json
.cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ==============================================================================
# Runtime & Logs
# ==============================================================================
/Saved/
/Log/
# 자동화 시나리오의 사본 폴더(`<Scratch>`, 실행마다 새로 만든다 — Engine/Scenario/AutomationScratch.h)
/Content/scratch/
Docs/Doxygen/

# ==============================================================================
# Binary & Compiled Objects
# ==============================================================================
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.lib
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.exp
*.gen.cpp
test_output_temp.bin

